      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T01:24:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this should fail if someone else is using the wrap. Previously, if someone else was using it, you could use it alongside them. The only scenario that would cause a failure was if the `context` structure was marked as unusable, which happens when the wrap is emptied or rewrapped (i.e. the content will be gone on success).\n\nYou are checking the content after acquiring the lock, so you\u0027re already handling the rewrap and empty cases, so I think this can also just block instead of using `try_lock()`.",
      "fixSuggestions": [
        {
          "fixId": "c79b6466_8a0dd0ea",
          "description": "prompt_to_edit API",
          "replacements": [
            {
              "path": "drivers/android/wrapfd/wrap.rs",
