        "id": 1934715
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T01:24:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Consider the case where the wrap is owned and the owner allows guests. Two distinct processes try to mmap the same wrap. Only one of them will succeed and the other one will fail, but in the original driver, I believe that would allow both processes to map the wrap. So, can we just have this block instead of `try_lock()`?",
